Package: nekobooru
Version: 4.1.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip
Recommends: ffmpeg, zenity | kdialog, xdg-utils
Maintainer: NekoBooru
Description: Local booru-style image and video library
 NekoBooru is a local image/video library with tags, pools, search,
 browser integration, and optional AI auto-tagging.
